          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bwe byawa Yoshua, n'abasaadha be abalwani boonaboona baava e Libuna, baaja baabwama okwezungulula ekibuga Lakishi era baakirumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwokubiri Musengwa Katonda yaakibata mu ngalo baakighangula. Baita buli muntu eyali mu kibuga omwo ng'oti ni bwe baakola abaali mu Libuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
