              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bwe byawa, Yoshua n'abasaadha be abalwani boonaboona, baava e Eguloni baaja baalumba ekibuga Heburoni ekyali mu biketezo eby'ensozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakigema era baita kyabazinga waamu n'abantu boonaboona abaakirimu. Baaja ni mu bibuga ebyali biriiraine Heburoni, yoona baitayo abantu abaaliyo boonaboona. Yoshua yaalagira abasaadha be okuzikiriza ekibuga kyonakyona nga bwe baazikiriza Eguloni. Ghaabulagho omuntu ye baaleka nga mulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
